		"description": "<p>Also at 3rd level, you can move at full speed while hiding without incurring penalties on your stealth checks so long as you start and end your movement in cover.</p><p>In addition, you can hide a number of one handed weapons equal to your proficiency bonus on your person without making a check. People searching you with an investigation check must beat your passive sleight of hand. Two handed weapons count as two one-handed weapons when you hide them.</p>",
